msgid ""
"To assign lot numbers, click on the product line. In the pop-up, specify the "
"lot number and the quantity against that lot number."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອລະບຸເລກຊຸດ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກໃສ່ແຖວສິນຄ້າ. ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງປັອບອັບ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸເລກຊຸດ ແລະ ຈຳນວນສຳລັບເລກຊຸດນັ້ນ."

#. module: pharmacy_retail
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pharmacy_retail.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Upon validation of the receipt, the system automatically sets the locations "
"(Racks) for the particular products received. \"<font class=\"text-o-"
"color-1\">Acetratine 10 mg</font>” product will be stored at \"\n"
"            <font class=\"text-o-color-1\">WH/Stock/Rack 2</font>”."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອກວດສອບຢືນຢັນໃບຮັບສິນຄ້າແລ້ວ, ລະບົບຈະກຳນົດສະຖານທີ່ (ຊັ້ນວາງ) ສຳລັບສິນຄ້າສະເພາະທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບໂດຍອັດຕະ"
"ໂນມັດ. ສິນຄ້າ \"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Acetratine 10 mg</font>” ຈະຖືກເກັບໄ"
"ວ້ທີ່ \"\n"
"            <font class=\"text-o-color-1\">WH/Stock/Rack 2</font>”."

#. module: pharmacy_retail
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pharmacy_retail.welcome_article_body
