#. module: pharmacy_retail
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pharmacy_retail.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When a customer wants to purchase \"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Himalaya "
"Baby Powder 100 g</font>,\" add \"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\">3</font>\" "
"quantity. When you select this product at that time, the system will fetch "
"the\n"
"            price from the product master and enter the Lot Number \"<font "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">A-003</font>\"."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອລູກຄ້າຕ້ອງການຊື້ \"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Himalaya Baby Powder 100 g</"
"font>,\" ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຈຳນວນ \"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\">3</font>\". ເມື່ອທ່ານເລືອກສິນ"
"ຄ້ານີ້ໃນເວລານັ້ນ, ລະບົບຈະດຶງເອົາ\n"
"            ລາຄາຈາກຂໍ້ມູນຫຼັກສິນຄ້າ ແລະ ໃສ່ເລກຊຸດ \"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\">A-"
"003</font>\"."

#. module: pharmacy_retail
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pharmacy_retail.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When the material is received, the user can either scan the barcode or "
"manually enter the Lot Number, Expiry Date and Quantity for \"<font "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">Acetratine 10 mg</font>” product received."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບສິນຄ້າແລ້ວ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດສະແກນບາໂຄດ ຫຼື ປ້ອນເລກຊຸດ, ວັນໝົດອາຍຸ ແລະ ຈຳນວນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ສຳລັບ"
"ສິນຄ້າ \"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Acetratine 10 mg</font>” ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ."

#. module: pharmacy_retail
